{"slug":"/students/subjects/biology/foundations/supporting-systems/","source":"students/subjects/biology/foundations/supporting-systems.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Supporting Systems | Biology","description":"","subject":"biology","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n        <nav class=\"mb-8\">\n            <a href=\"/students/subjects/biology/foundations/\" class=\"text-emerald-600 hover:text-emerald-700\">← Back to Foundations</a>\n        </nav>\n        \n        <div class=\"content-card rounded-xl p-8\">\n            <header class=\"mb-8\">\n                <h1 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Supporting Systems</h1>\n                <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600\">From tissues to organ systems: How organisms are organized</p>\n            </header>\n\n            <div class=\"space-y-8\">\n                <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Learning Objectives</h2>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>• Understand the hierarchy of biological organization</li>\n                        <li>• Identify and describe different types of tissues</li>\n                        <li>• Explain how tissues form organs and organ systems</li>\n                        <li>• Analyze the relationship between structure and function</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Video Content -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Video Lessons</h2>\n                    <div class=\"aspect-w-16 aspect-h-9 mb-4\">\n                        <iframe title=\"Supporting Systems Overview\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VIDEO_ID\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" class=\"w-full h-[400px] rounded-lg\"></iframe>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 1: Tissue Types</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Understanding different tissue types and their roles</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Video 2: From Tissues to Systems</h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">How tissues work together in organs and systems</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Key Concepts -->\n                <section class=\"space-y-6\">\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800\">Key Concepts</h2>\n                    \n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. Levels of Organization</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Cells → Tissues → Organs → Organ Systems → Organism</li>\n                            <li>• Integration of systems</li>\n                            <li>• Specialization at each level</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Types of Tissues</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Epithelial tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Protection and secretion</li>\n                                    <li>- Types and locations</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Connective tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Support and connection</li>\n                                    <li>- Blood, bone, cartilage</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Muscle tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Movement and contraction</li>\n                                    <li>- Types of muscle</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• Nervous tissue:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Signal transmission</li>\n                                    <li>- Neural networks</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Organ Formation</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Tissue organization</li>\n                            <li>• Organ structure</li>\n                            <li>• Functional integration</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">4. Organ Systems</h3>\n                        <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-gray-700\">\n                            <li>• Major organ systems:\n                                <ul class=\"ml-4\">\n                                    <li>- Digestive</li>\n                                    <li>- Respiratory</li>\n                                    <li>- Circulatory</li>\n                                    <li>- Others</li>\n                                </ul>\n                            </li>\n                            <li>• System integration</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Practical Activities -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Practical Activities</h2>\n                    <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Tissue Examination</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Microscope slides of tissues</li>\n                                <li>• Drawing tissue structures</li>\n                                <li>• Identifying tissue types</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <h3 class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">System Models</h3>\n                            <ul class=\"space-y-1 text-sm text-gray-700\">\n                                <li>• Building organ models</li>\n                                <li>• System diagrams</li>\n                                <li>• Virtual dissections</li>\n                            </ul>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n\n                <!-- Assessment Questions -->\n                <section>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-4\">Self-Assessment</h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">1. How do different tissues work together in an organ?</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Consider the stomach as an example.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">2. Compare and contrast different types of tissue.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Think about structure and function relationships.</p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"p-4 bg-white/50 rounded-lg\">\n                            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">3. Explain how organ systems interact.</p>\n                            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">Use the digestive and circulatory systems as examples.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }\n        .content-card {\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);\n        }"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}